# Plone Mraz

> Huỳnh Mai Phúc (Plone Mraz) — self-funded independent researcher working outside any
> institution, Vietnam. A research programme on the operation by which configurations
> come into being and hold, plus applied work, essays, and original characters.

Every paper and dataset is deposited with a permanent DOI. Papers are written in
English; essays are written in Vietnamese. The site interface is bilingual — both
languages are present in the HTML and toggled with CSS, so raw page text will contain
each label twice. This file is the clean index.

- Site: https://plonemraz.github.io
- ORCID: https://orcid.org/0009-0009-0571-7151
- Contact: plone.mraz@gmail.com
- Feed: https://plonemraz.github.io/feed.xml
- Sitemap: https://plonemraz.github.io/sitemap.xml

